 "title": "Jivrus Technologies - Security Policy",
 "description": "Purpose Jivrus Technologies is committed to protecting the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of its information assets and ensuring the safety and privacy of its customers' data. As a cloud software company, Jivrus Technologies recognizes the importance of information security in",
 "h1": "Security Policy",
